  "sketch": {
   "source": "// Night light: the LED turns on when the room gets dark.\nconst int LDR_PIN = A0;\nconst int LED = 8;\nconst int DARK_BELOW = 400;   // 0..1023, lower = darker\n\nvoid setup() {\n  pinMode(LED, OUTPUT);\n}\n\nvoid loop() {\n  int level = analogRead(LDR_PIN);\n  digitalWrite(LED, level < DARK_BELOW ? HIGH : LOW);\n  delay(50);\n}\n"
  },
